Subject: Re: Lus paa tjaerekost (or molasses in january)
In-Reply-To: <201611111051.DAA02602@asgard.dartmouth.edu>

On Fri, 11 Nov 116, Johan Grape wrote:
> 
> System: Aspen durango 433MHz (PC164) 128Megs RAM
>  	NCR Fast SCSI-2
